<template>
  <view class="business-page">
    <SiteHeader active="simulate" />
    <view class="wrap">
      <view class="top"><button class="back" @tap="back">← 模拟项目</button><button class="reset" @tap="confirmReset">重新体验</button></view>
      <view class="hero"><view><text class="eyebrow">AI 项目体验 · 01</text><text class="title">经营一家教师壁纸小店</text><text class="subtitle">亲手做一张壁纸，让它被看到，再看看有没有人愿意购买。</text></view><view class="time"><text>约 8 分钟</text><text>本机保存进度</text></view></view>
      <view class="disclaimer">这是模拟经营：人物、素材、费用、流量、订单和收益均为虚构，不会发布笔记、收款或生成真实壁纸。所有数字仅是游戏规则，不代表实际收益。</view>
      <view class="forecast"><view class="forecast-head"><view><text class="forecast-kicker">本轮预计可得 · 假设经营 30 天</text><text class="forecast-money">¥{{forecastRemaining}}</text></view><view class="forecast-initial"><text>开局设定 ¥{{forecastInitial}}</text><text>累计扣减 ¥{{forecastDeductions}}</text></view></view><text class="forecast-explain">30 天与金额均为游戏设定，非真实平均收入或收益预测；下方到账仅指目前模拟完成的订单，两者不能相加。</text><text v-if="state.forecastLegacy" class="forecast-explain">你此前已有试玩进度，新规则从现在开始记录，不追溯过去的操作。</text><view v-if="!state.forecastLosses.length" class="forecast-empty">暂时没有扣减，预计金额保持不变。</view><view v-else-if="!forecastExpanded" class="forecast-entry"><text>最近扣减：{{state.forecastLosses[state.forecastLosses.length-1].reason}}</text><text>−¥{{state.forecastLosses[state.forecastLosses.length-1].amount}}</text></view><button class="forecast-toggle" @tap="forecastExpanded=!forecastExpanded">{{forecastExpanded?'收起规则和明细 ↑':'查看扣减规则和明细 ↓'}}</button><view v-if="forecastExpanded"><view v-for="loss in state.forecastLosses" :key="loss.id" class="forecast-entry"><text>{{loss.reason}}</text><text>−¥{{loss.amount}}</text></view><text class="forecast-explain">游戏规则：首条笔记发布时未准备付费商品，扣 ¥250；付费商品定价 ¥20 及以上并发布笔记，本局首次扣 ¥200；确认结算时仍有待交付订单，本局首次扣 ¥150。同一类最多扣一次，已扣金额不恢复；调整后可继续体验，重新体验可从头开始。</text><text class="forecast-explain">完成体验约需 8 分钟；30 天只是本局设想的经营周期，并非真实训练天数或来源数据。这项预计金额与下方按模拟订单计算的“交付后到账”属于不同游戏规则，两者不能相加，也不一定一致。</text><text class="forecast-source">真实案例目前仅核实到一位作者自述累计变现“几千元”，资料不足以计算平均收入，因此这里使用独立的游戏金额。</text></view></view>
      <view class="mission"><view class="mission-icon">✦</view><view><text class="mission-label">{{ missionLabel }}</text><text class="mission-text">{{ mission }}</text></view></view>
      <view class="stats"><view><text>模拟本金</text><text>¥{{initialCash}}</text></view><view><text>模拟花费</text><text>¥{{state.expenses}}</text></view><view><text>交付后到账</text><text>¥{{received}}</text></view><view><text>当前现金</text><text>¥{{cash}}</text></view></view>

      <view class="desk">
        <view class="store pane">
          <view class="pane-head"><view><text class="kicker">YOUR LITTLE SHOP</text><text class="pane-title">你的壁纸小店</text></view><text class="status">模拟店铺</text></view>
          <view class="phone"><view class="phone-top"><text>9:41</text><text>···</text></view><view class="phone-body"><text class="phone-kicker">给每天认真生活的老师</text><text class="shop-title">老师的壁纸角</text><text class="shop-desc">挑一张喜欢的，陪你度过今天。</text>
            <view v-if="state.freePublished" class="shop-card" @tap="showShopPreview"><view :class="['wallpaper',state.freeTheme]"><text class="wallpaper-line">{{state.freeHeadline}}</text><text class="wallpaper-mark">FOR EVERY TEACHER</text></view><view class="shop-meta"><text>今日免费壁纸</text><text>免费</text></view></view>
            <view v-else class="empty-shop">小店里还没有壁纸，先做一张并上架吧。</view>
            <view v-if="state.paidPublished" class="shop-paid"><view :class="['paid-thumb',state.paidTheme]"></view><view class="paid-info"><text class="paid-name">{{state.productName}}</text><text class="paid-detail">{{state.paidHeadline}} · 模拟商品</text></view><text class="price">¥{{state.productPrice}}</text></view>
            <text v-else class="phone-hint">精选商品准备中</text>
          </view></view>
          <text class="store-note">你制作、修改和上架的内容会出现在这里。点击已上架的壁纸可以查看。</text>
          <view v-if="state.posts.length" class="activity"><text class="activity-title">小店的来访记录</text><view v-for="post in state.posts" :key="post.id" class="activity-row"><text>第 {{post.number}} 条模拟笔记</text><text>{{post.views}} 次曝光 · {{post.visits}} 次进店</text></view></view>
        </view>

        <view class="actions pane">
          <view class="tabs"><button :class="{active:state.tab==='make'}" @tap="state.tab='make'">做壁纸</button><button :class="{active:state.tab==='post'}" @tap="state.tab='post'">发笔记</button><button :class="{active:state.tab==='product'}" @tap="state.tab='product'">付费商品</button><button :class="{active:state.tab==='orders'}" @tap="state.tab='orders'">订单与复盘</button></view>

          <view v-if="state.tab==='make'" class="section"><text class="kicker">01 / MAKE SOMETHING</text><text class="section-title">先做一张有人愿意用的壁纸。</text><text class="description">林老师的模拟留言：想找一张打开手机就觉得有力量的壁纸，不要太花。</text>
            <view class="maker"><view :class="['wallpaper','draft',state.draftTheme]"><text class="wallpaper-line">{{state.draftHeadline || '在这里写一句话'}}</text><text class="wallpaper-mark">FOR EVERY TEACHER</text></view><view class="maker-controls"><text class="field-title">选一个背景</text><view class="swatches"><button v-for="theme in themes" :key="theme.id" :class="['swatch',theme.id,{chosen:state.draftTheme===theme.id}]" @tap="state.draftTheme=theme.id"><text>{{theme.label}}</text><text v-if="state.draftTheme===theme.id">✓</text></button></view><label class="field"><text class="field-title">写一句放在壁纸上的话</text><input :value="state.draftHeadline" maxlength="18" @input="state.draftHeadline=$event.detail.value" placeholder="例如：今天也很棒"/></label><button class="primary" :disabled="!state.draftHeadline.trim()||(!state.freePublished&&cash<5)" @tap="publishFree">{{state.freePublished?'更新小店里的壁纸':'上架免费壁纸 · 模拟花费 ¥5'}}</button><text class="hint">{{state.freePublished?'更新当前展示，不再扣费。':'你选的背景和文字会出现在小店预览；¥5 是虚构的素材成本，不是现实报价。'}}</text><text v-if="!state.freePublished&&cash<5" class="hint">模拟现金不足，可点顶部“重新体验”再试。</text></view></view>
          </view>

          <view v-if="state.tab==='post'" class="section"><text class="kicker">02 / SHARE</text><text class="section-title">让第一批人看到你的作品。</text><text class="description">写一条模拟笔记，封面就是你上架的壁纸。可以自己修改，发布只发生在这个游戏里。</text>
            <view v-if="!state.freePublished" class="locked"><text>小店还没有作品。先做一张壁纸，再来写笔记。</text><button class="secondary" @tap="state.tab='make'">去做壁纸 →</button></view>
            <template v-else><view class="post-editor"><view :class="['wallpaper','post-cover',state.freeTheme]"><text class="wallpaper-line">{{state.freeHeadline}}</text><text class="wallpaper-mark">笔记封面 · 模拟</text></view><view class="post-fields"><label class="field"><text class="field-title">模拟账号昵称</text><input :value="state.account" maxlength="18" @input="state.account=$event.detail.value"/></label><label class="field"><text class="field-title">笔记标题</text><input :value="state.noteTitle" maxlength="30" @input="state.noteTitle=$event.detail.value"/></label><label class="field"><text class="field-title">介绍这张壁纸</text><textarea :value="state.noteBody" maxlength="180" @input="state.noteBody=$event.detail.value"/></label></view></view>
              <text class="hint">游戏设定：每条模拟笔记固定获得 180 次曝光、24 人进店；有付费商品时，售价 ¥1–9 模拟 2 单，¥10–19 模拟 1 单，¥20–99 暂无订单。这些数字仅供练习，不预测真实流量或成交。</text><button class="primary" :disabled="!canPost" @tap="publishPost">{{state.posts.length?'再发布一条模拟笔记 · 花费 ¥5':'发布模拟笔记 · 花费 ¥5'}}</button><text class="hint">¥5 是虚构的素材与运营成本，不是平台发帖收费。仅使用游戏里的虚构账号，不需要输入真实账号或密码。</text><text v-if="cash<5" class="hint">模拟现金不足，可交付待处理订单或点顶部“重新体验”。</text>
            </template>
          </view>

          <view v-if="state.tab==='product'" class="section"><text class="kicker">03 / YOUR PRODUCT</text><text class="section-title">做一张不同的精选壁纸。</text><text class="description">基于免费作品的反馈，再做一张精选版。你可以先发免费笔记，也可以先准备好商品。</text>
            <view v-if="!state.freePublished" class="locked"><text>先制作一张壁纸，才能把它放进商品里。</text><button class="secondary" @tap="state.tab='make'">去做壁纸 →</button></view>
            <template v-else><view class="product-preview"><view :class="['wallpaper','product-cover',state.paidDraftTheme]"><text class="wallpaper-line">{{state.paidDraftHeadline || '精选壁纸'}}</text></view><view><text class="field-title">这张精选版长什么样？</text><text class="description">选择背景、修改文字，让它和免费壁纸不同。本次交付只包含一张模拟壁纸，不会发送真实文件。</text></view></view><text class="field-title" style="margin-top:14px">精选版背景</text><view class="swatches"><button v-for="theme in themes" :key="theme.id" :class="['swatch',theme.id,{chosen:state.paidDraftTheme===theme.id}]" @tap="state.paidDraftTheme=theme.id"><text>{{theme.label}}</text><text v-if="state.paidDraftTheme===theme.id">✓</text></button></view><label class="field"><text class="field-title">精选版的文字</text><input :value="state.paidDraftHeadline" maxlength="18" @input="state.paidDraftHeadline=$event.detail.value"/></label><label class="field"><text class="field-title">商品名称</text><input :value="state.productDraft" maxlength="24" @input="state.productDraft=$event.detail.value"/></label><label class="field"><text class="field-title">模拟售价（¥1–99）</text><input type="number" :value="state.priceDraft" @input="state.priceDraft=$event.detail.value"/></label><button class="primary" :disabled="!canList" @tap="listProduct">{{state.paidPublished?'更新模拟商品':'上架单张壁纸 · 模拟花费 ¥15'}}</button><text v-if="!differentPaid" class="hint">请调整背景或文字，让精选版与免费壁纸不同。</text><text v-if="!state.paidPublished&&cash<15" class="hint">模拟现金不足，可交付待处理订单或点顶部“重新体验”。</text><text class="hint">¥15 是虚构的制作成本，不是现实报价；只有模拟订单完成交付后，才会记作到账收入。</text></template>
          </view>

          <view v-if="state.tab==='orders'" class="section"><text class="kicker">04 / WHAT HAPPENED</text><text class="section-title">看看来访者和你的小店。</text><text class="description">这里的反馈与数字按固定规则产生，用于体验，不是真实顾客或市场预测。</text>
            <view v-if="!state.posts.length" class="locked"><text>还没有发布模拟笔记，小店暂时没有来访记录。</text><button class="secondary" @tap="state.tab='post'">去写第一条笔记 →</button></view>
            <template v-else><view class="feedback"><text class="feedback-kicker">第一批模拟反馈</text><text class="quote">“这张很适合老师，我想要更多这样的壁纸。”</text><text class="feedback-note">{{firstSummary}}</text></view>
              <view v-if="!state.paidPublished" class="next-card"><text>你的店里还没有付费商品。可以先准备，也可以直接看看这轮复盘。</text><view class="button-row"><button class="primary" @tap="state.tab='product'">准备付费商品 →</button><button class="secondary" @tap="showRoundResult">先看这轮复盘</button></view></view>
              <view v-else-if="!state.orders.length" class="next-card"><text>{{lastPaidPost?'上一条笔记的商品售价在本游戏规则下没有产生模拟订单；可以调整价格再试，或先看看复盘。':'精选壁纸已上架。再发一条模拟笔记，看看已准备好商品后会发生什么。'}}</text><view class="button-row"><button v-if="lastPaidPost" class="primary" @tap="state.tab='product'">去调整商品 →</button><button v-else class="primary" @tap="state.tab='post'">去发布模拟笔记 →</button><button class="secondary" @tap="showRoundResult">先看这轮复盘</button></view></view>
              <view v-else><text class="orders-title">模拟订单</text><view v-for="order in state.orders" :key="order.id" class="order"><view><text class="order-title">{{order.product}}</text><text class="order-meta">下单时的作品：{{order.headline || '精选壁纸'}}</text><text class="order-meta">模拟订单 · ¥{{order.amount}} · {{order.delivered?'已交付、已到账':'待交付，尚未到账'}}</text></view><button class="tiny" :disabled="order.delivered" @tap="deliver(order)">{{order.delivered?'已交付':'模拟交付'}}</button></view><text class="hint">交付前订单金额不算收入；交付后才计入“到账收入”。有待交付订单时确认结算，会按本轮规则扣减预计金额 ¥150。</text><button class="secondary result-button" @tap="showRoundResult">结算并查看经营复盘 →</button></view>
              <view v-if="state.showResult" class="result"><text class="result-kicker">本次体验 · 模拟复盘</text><text class="result-title">从作品，到被看到，再到准备成交。</text><view class="result-line"><text>开局 30 天预计（游戏假设）</text><text>¥{{forecastInitial}}</text></view><view class="result-line"><text>本轮操作扣减</text><text>−¥{{forecastDeductions}}</text></view><view class="result-line"><text>30 天剩余预计（非实际到账）</text><text>¥{{forecastRemaining}}</text></view><view class="result-line"><text>模拟笔记</text><text>{{state.posts.length}} 条</text></view><view class="result-line"><text>累计模拟曝光 / 进店</text><text>{{totalViews}} / {{totalVisits}}</text></view><view class="result-line"><text>模拟订单 / 已交付</text><text>{{state.orders.length}} / {{deliveredCount}}</text></view><view class="result-line"><text>模拟到账 − 模拟花费</text><text>¥{{received}} − ¥{{state.expenses}} = {{profit>=0?'+':''}}¥{{profit}}</text></view><text class="hint">{{resultInsight}} 30 天预计是游戏假设；模拟到账仅统计目前已经交付的订单。两者不能相加，均非真实预测，也未计算真实工时。</text><button class="secondary result-button" @tap="copySummary">复制我的体验记录</button></view>
              <view v-if="state.showResult" class="source"><text>真实案例的启发</text><text>一位圈友分享过教师壁纸小程序：她提到流量较好时付费产品尚未准备。这里的内容、用户反馈、次数和金额均由 AINPE 独立模拟，不是作者的真实经营数据。</text></view>
            </template>
          </view>
        </view>
      </view>
      <view v-if="state.showResult"><SimCamp /></view>
    </view>
  <SiteFooter /></view>
</template>
<script setup>
import SiteFooter from '../../components/SiteFooter.vue';
import {computed, reactive, ref, watch} from 'vue';
import SiteHeader from '../../components/SiteHeader.vue';
import SimCamp from './SimCamp.vue';
const KEY='ainpe:sim:wallpaper-business:v1';
const initialCash=100;
const forecastInitial=1000;
const forecastExpanded=ref(false);
const fresh=()=>({tab:'make',draftTheme:'sage',draftHeadline:'今天也要元气满满',freePublished:false,freeTheme:'sage',freeHeadline:'',account:'老师壁纸小店',noteTitle:'送给老师的一张治愈壁纸',noteBody:'做了一张简洁的壁纸，希望陪你度过忙碌的一天。',paidDraftTheme:'peach',paidDraftHeadline:'你在发光',paidTheme:'peach',paidHeadline:'',productDraft:'老师的精选壁纸',priceDraft:'9',paidPublished:false,productName:'',productPrice:9,expenses:0,posts:[],orders:[],showResult:false,forecastLosses:[],forecastLegacy:false});
let stored={};try{stored=uni.getStorageSync(KEY)||{}}catch{}
const existingProgress=stored&&typeof stored==='object'&&!Array.isArray(stored.forecastLosses)&&Boolean(stored.freePublished||(Array.isArray(stored.posts)&&stored.posts.length)||(Array.isArray(stored.orders)&&stored.orders.length));
const state=reactive({...fresh(),...(stored&&typeof stored==='object'?stored:{})});
if(!Array.isArray(state.posts))state.posts=[];if(!Array.isArray(state.orders))state.orders=[];
if(!Array.isArray(state.forecastLosses))state.forecastLosses=[];if(existingProgress)state.forecastLegacy=true;
watch(state,()=>{try{uni.setStorageSync(KEY,JSON.parse(JSON.stringify(state)))}catch{}},{deep:true});
const themes=[{id:'sage',label:'清新绿'},{id:'peach',label:'暖阳橙'},{id:'sky',label:'静谧蓝'}];
const forecastDeductions=computed(()=>state.forecastLosses.reduce((sum,item)=>sum+item.amount,0));
const forecastRemaining=computed(()=>Math.max(0,forecastInitial-forecastDeductions.value));
const received=computed(()=>state.orders.filter(o=>o.delivered).reduce((n,o)=>n+o.amount,0));
const deliveredCount=computed(()=>state.orders.filter(o=>o.delivered).length);
const cash=computed(()=>initialCash-state.expenses+received.value);
const profit=computed(()=>received.value-state.expenses);
const totalViews=computed(()=>state.posts.reduce((n,p)=>n+p.views,0));
const totalVisits=computed(()=>state.posts.reduce((n,p)=>n+p.visits,0));
const lastPaidPost=computed(()=>state.posts.some(p=>p.hadProduct));
const canPost=computed(()=>Boolean(state.account.trim()&&state.noteTitle.trim()&&state.noteBody.trim())&&cash.value>=5);
const numberPrice=computed(()=>Number(state.priceDraft));
const differentPaid=computed(()=>Boolean(state.paidDraftHeadline.trim())&&(state.paidDraftTheme!==state.freeTheme||state.paidDraftHeadline.trim()!==state.freeHeadline));
const canList=computed(()=>Boolean(state.productDraft.trim())&&differentPaid.value&&Number.isInteger(numberPrice.value)&&numberPrice.value>=1&&numberPrice.value<=99&&(state.paidPublished||cash.value>=15));
const firstSummary=computed(()=>{const first=state.posts[0];return first?.hadProduct?'第一条笔记发布时你已准备好商品；可以查看本轮模拟订单与反馈。':'游戏设定有 3 人表达兴趣，但当时店里还没有付费商品；这不是已经发生的订单或收入。'});
const resultInsight=computed(()=>{const first=state.posts[0];if(first?.hadProduct)return '你在第一批访客到来前准备了商品；能否卖出仍取决于真实用户与经营。';if(state.paidPublished)return '第一批访客到来时你尚未准备付费商品；后来你已上架精选壁纸，可以继续观察模拟反馈。';return '第一批访客到来时你尚未准备付费商品；你可以回到商品页准备后再体验。'});
const missionLabel=computed(()=>state.orders.some(o=>!o.delivered)?'下一步 · 处理订单':!state.freePublished?'第 1 件事 · 做出作品':!state.posts.length?'第 2 件事 · 找到第一批用户':!state.paidPublished?'第 3 件事 · 想想如何变现':!state.orders.length?'第 4 件事 · 再让用户看到':'本轮体验完成');
const mission=computed(()=>state.orders.some(o=>!o.delivered)?'点“订单与复盘”，完成模拟交付，看看实际到账。':!state.freePublished?'选一个背景、写一句话，再把壁纸上架。':!state.posts.length?'到“发笔记”写一条内容，也可以先准备付费商品。':!state.paidPublished?'看看用户反馈，可以准备一张精选付费壁纸。':!state.orders.length?'付费商品已经准备好，再发一条模拟笔记。':'看看这次做了什么，哪些环节影响了结果。');
function publishFree(){if(!state.draftHeadline.trim())return;if(!state.freePublished){if(cash.value<5)return;state.expenses+=5}state.freeTheme=state.draftTheme;state.freeHeadline=state.draftHeadline.trim();state.freePublished=true;uni.showToast({title:'已上架模拟壁纸',icon:'none'});}
function recordForecastLoss(id,amount,reason){if(state.forecastLosses.some(item=>item.id===id))return;state.forecastLosses.push({id,amount:Math.min(amount,forecastRemaining.value),reason});}
function publishPost(){if(!state.freePublished||!canPost.value)return;state.expenses+=5;const n=state.posts.length+1;if(n===1&&!state.paidPublished)recordForecastLoss('first-without-product',250,'首条笔记发布时还没有付费商品，错过首批转化机会');if(state.paidPublished&&state.productPrice>=20)recordForecastLoss('price-no-orders',200,'在本局价格规则下，这次推广没有产生订单');state.posts.push({id:`post-${Date.now()}-${n}`,number:n,views:180,visits:24,hadProduct:state.paidPublished,title:state.noteTitle.trim()});const count=!state.paidPublished?0:state.productPrice<=9?2:state.productPrice<=19?1:0;for(let i=0;i<count;i++)state.orders.push({id:`order-${Date.now()}-${n}-${i}`,product:state.productName,headline:state.paidHeadline,theme:state.paidTheme,amount:state.productPrice,delivered:false});state.showResult=false;state.tab='orders';}
function listProduct(){if(!state.freePublished||!canList.value)return;if(!state.paidPublished)state.expenses+=15;state.productName=state.productDraft.trim();state.productPrice=numberPrice.value;state.paidTheme=state.paidDraftTheme;state.paidHeadline=state.paidDraftHeadline.trim();state.paidPublished=true;state.showResult=false;uni.showToast({title:'已上架模拟商品',icon:'none'});}
function deliver(order){if(!order.delivered)order.delivered=true;}
function showRoundResult(){if(state.orders.some(order=>!order.delivered)&&!state.forecastLosses.some(item=>item.id==='unfinished-delivery')){uni.showModal({title:'还有订单未交付',content:'现在结算会按游戏规则扣减预计金额 ¥150，之后交付也不会恢复已扣金额。你可以先取消并继续交付。',confirmText:'确认结算',cancelText:'继续交付',success:r=>{if(r.confirm){recordForecastLoss('unfinished-delivery',150,'确认结算时仍有模拟订单尚未交付');state.showResult=true;}}});return}state.showResult=true;}
function showShopPreview(){uni.showToast({title:'这是你上架的模拟壁纸',icon:'none'});}
function copySummary(){const losses=state.forecastLosses.map(item=>`${item.reason}：−¥${item.amount}`).join('\n')||'无';const data=`模拟项目：教师壁纸小店\n假设经营 30 天的本轮预计：开局 ¥${forecastInitial} − 扣减 ¥${forecastDeductions.value} = ¥${forecastRemaining.value}\n扣减明细：\n${losses}\n作品：${state.freeHeadline}\n模拟笔记：${state.posts.length} 条\n模拟曝光 / 进店：${totalViews.value} / ${totalVisits.value}\n模拟订单 / 已交付：${state.orders.length} / ${deliveredCount.value}\n模拟花费：¥${state.expenses}\n当前模拟到账：¥${received.value}\n模拟盈亏：¥${profit.value}\n30 天预计是游戏设定，与模拟到账为不同规则，不能相加，均非真实收入预测。`;uni.setClipboardData({data});}
function confirmReset(){uni.showModal({title:'重新体验？',content:'会清除这台设备中这次模拟小店的作品、订单和记录，其他项目不受影响。',success:r=>{if(r.confirm)Object.assign(state,fresh())}})}
function back(){uni.navigateBack({fail:()=>uni.redirectTo({url:'/pages/simulate/index'})})}
</script>
